{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29995","headline":"得子侄书 · 喻凫","name":"得子侄书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远书来阮巷，阙下见江东。\n不得经史力，枉抛耕稼功。\n鴈天霞脚雨，渔夜苇条风。\n无复琴桮兴，开怀向尔同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻凫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}